<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- Dismember (Source/1.6/Abilities/Dismember/). {0} is the target -->
  <!-- EN: {0} has no limbs to tear off. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberNoLimbs>{0}沒有可以扯下的肢體。</HPWC_DismemberNoLimbs>
  <!-- EN: {0} is not hostile. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberNotHostile>{0}不是敵對的。</HPWC_DismemberNotHostile>
  <!-- Beside the cursor over a target, where the game's own "Will kill" goes: the strike would tear off none of the limbs it could take hold of, or only some of them -->
  <!-- EN: Will only wound -->
  <HPWC_DismemberWillWound>只會致傷</HPWC_DismemberWillWound>
  <!-- EN: May only wound -->
  <HPWC_DismemberMayWound>可能只會致傷</HPWC_DismemberMayWound>
  <!-- The dialog before an order that would kill a target that is not hostile, where the game asks "Bloodfeeding on {PAWN_nameDef} will kill {PAWN_objective}." before a lethal bite: the strike would tear the head off a target with no limbs left, or the drain after it would bleed the target to death. PAWN is the target -->
  <!-- EN: The strike will tear off {PAWN_nameDef}'s head, which will kill {PAWN_objective}.\n\nAre you sure? -->
  <HPWC_DismemberConfirmKill>這次打擊會扯下{PAWN_nameDef}的頭，把{PAWN_objective}殺死。\n\n你確定嗎?</HPWC_DismemberConfirmKill>
  <!-- EN: Draining hemogen from {PAWN_nameDef} after the strike will kill {PAWN_objective}.\n\nAre you sure? -->
  <HPWC_DismemberConfirmDrainKill>打擊後若從{PAWN_nameDef}身上汲取血原，會把{PAWN_objective}殺死。\n\n你確定嗎?</HPWC_DismemberConfirmDrainKill>
  <!-- The last line of the ability's tooltip. {0} is a count of the reload item, such as "1 component" -->
  <!-- EN: Each strike will burn out one of the servos in the shoulders, which can be replaced by reloading with {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberReload>每次打擊都會燒壞護肩裡的一個伺服機構，裝填{0}即可換上新的。</HPWC_DismemberReload>

  <!-- Mod settings (Source/1.6/Settings/) -->
  <!-- EN: Hemophage Warcasket -->
  <HPWC_SettingsCategory>噬血型戰棺</HPWC_SettingsCategory>
  <!-- Shown in place of the ability and helmet sections (HemophageWarcasketSettings.TryGetDefs) -->
  <!-- EN: The ability and helmet settings are unavailable. Another mod has changed the hemophage warcasket, so they will keep their built-in values. -->
  <HPWC_SettingsUnavailable>能力和頭盔設定目前無法使用。另一個模組修改了噬血型戰棺，因此兩者都會沿用內建數值。</HPWC_SettingsUnavailable>

  <!-- After a slider's value while it is unset -->
  <!-- EN:  (default) -->
  <HPWC_DefaultSuffix>(預設)</HPWC_DefaultSuffix>
  <!-- A checkbox's default in its tooltip -->
  <!-- EN: enabled -->
  <HPWC_Enabled>啟用</HPWC_Enabled>
  <!-- EN: disabled -->
  <HPWC_Disabled>停用</HPWC_Disabled>
  <!-- A slider's value at its off end -->
  <!-- EN: Off -->
  <HPWC_Off>關閉</HPWC_Off>

  <!-- Hemogen rush section (Source/1.6/Settings/Settings_Rush.cs). {0} in every tooltip is the default -->
  <!-- EN: Hemogen rush -->
  <HPWC_SectionRush>血原爆發</HPWC_SectionRush>

  <!-- EN: Hemogen cost to start -->
  <HPWC_RushStartCost>啟動血原消耗</HPWC_RushStartCost>
  <!-- EN: The amount of hemogen the pilot spends each time a rush starts. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_RushStartCostDesc>每次啟動血原爆發時，駕駛員要先付出的血原量。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_RushStartCostDesc>

  <!-- EN: Hemogen per second -->
  <HPWC_RushDrain>每秒血原消耗</HPWC_RushDrain>
  <!-- EN: The amount of hemogen the pilot spends each second while the rush is running. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_RushDrainDesc>爆發持續期間，駕駛員每秒會再消耗多少血原。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_RushDrainDesc>

  <!-- EN: Hemogen reserve -->
  <HPWC_RushReserve>血原保留量</HPWC_RushReserve>
  <!-- EN: The hemogen level at which the rush will stop on its own. At zero, it will run until the pilot has no hemogen left and develops a hemogen craving. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_RushReserveDesc>血原降到這個量時，血原爆發會自行停止。設為0時，爆發會一直持續到駕駛員的血原耗盡，並陷入血原渴求。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_RushReserveDesc>

  <!-- EN: Move speed -->
  <HPWC_RushMoveSpeed>移動速度</HPWC_RushMoveSpeed>
  <!-- EN: The pilot's move speed during a hemogen rush, compared to normal. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_RushMoveSpeedDesc>血原爆發期間，駕駛員的移動速度相對於平時的比例。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_RushMoveSpeedDesc>

  <!-- EN: Melee damage -->
  <HPWC_RushMeleeDamage>近戰傷害</HPWC_RushMeleeDamage>
  <!-- EN: How much damage the pilot's melee attacks will do during a hemogen rush, compared to normal. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_RushMeleeDamageDesc>與平時相比，駕駛員在血原爆發期間的近戰攻擊能造成多少傷害。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_RushMeleeDamageDesc>

  <!-- EN: Pulsing glow -->
  <HPWC_RushGlowPulse>脈動光芒</HPWC_RushGlowPulse>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, the warcasket's glow will pulse like a heartbeat during a hemogen rush. When disabled, the glow will stay at full brightness. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_RushGlowPulseDesc>啟用時，血原爆發期間戰棺的光芒會像心跳一樣忽明忽暗。停用時，光芒會維持最大亮度。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_RushGlowPulseDesc>

  <!-- {0} hemogen per second, {1} the reserve, {2} how long the rush lasts, {3} and {4} percentages, {5} the cost to start. One key per combination of a start cost and a drain -->
  <!-- EN: A hemogen rush costs {5} hemogen to start, then spends {0} hemogen per second and stops at {1}, so a rush started at 100 hemogen lasts {2}. The pilot moves at {3} speed and does {4} melee damage. -->
  <HPWC_RushSummaryStartCost>啟動血原爆發需要{5}點血原，之後每秒消耗{0}點血原，降到{1}時停止，因此從100點血原開始的爆發可持續{2}。駕駛員的移動速度為{3}，近戰傷害為{4}。</HPWC_RushSummaryStartCost>
  <!-- EN: A hemogen rush spends {0} hemogen per second and stops at {1}, so a rush started at 100 hemogen lasts {2}. The pilot moves at {3} speed and does {4} melee damage. -->
  <HPWC_RushSummary>血原爆發每秒消耗{0}點血原，降到{1}時停止，因此從100點血原開始的爆發可持續{2}。駕駛員的移動速度為{3}，近戰傷害為{4}。</HPWC_RushSummary>
  <!-- {0} and {1} are the percentages, {2} the cost to start -->
  <!-- EN: A hemogen rush costs {2} hemogen to start and spends none after that, so it runs until the pilot stops it. The pilot moves at {0} speed and does {1} melee damage. -->
  <HPWC_RushSummaryStartCostNoDrain>啟動血原爆發需要{2}點血原，之後不再消耗，因此爆發會一直持續到駕駛員自行停止。駕駛員的移動速度為{0}，近戰傷害為{1}。</HPWC_RushSummaryStartCostNoDrain>
  <!-- EN: A hemogen rush spends no hemogen, so it runs until the pilot stops it. The pilot moves at {0} speed and does {1} melee damage. -->
  <HPWC_RushSummaryFree>血原爆發不消耗血原，因此會一直持續到駕駛員自行停止。駕駛員的移動速度為{0}，近戰傷害為{1}。</HPWC_RushSummaryFree>

  <!-- Dismember section (Source/1.6/Settings/Settings_Dismember.cs) -->
  <!-- EN: Dismember -->
  <HPWC_SectionDismember>肢解</HPWC_SectionDismember>

  <!-- EN: Strike capacity -->
  <HPWC_DismemberStrikes>打擊容量</HPWC_DismemberStrikes>
  <!-- EN: The number of strikes the shoulders hold when full. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberStrikesDesc>護肩裝滿時可儲存的打擊數量。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberStrikesDesc>

  <!-- {1} is the reload item in the plural, such as "components" -->
  <!-- EN: Reload cost per strike -->
  <HPWC_DismemberReloadCost>每次打擊的裝填花費</HPWC_DismemberReloadCost>
  <!-- EN: The number of {1} it takes to reload one strike. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberReloadCostDesc>裝填一次打擊所需的{1}數量。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberReloadCostDesc>

  <!-- EN: Casting time -->
  <HPWC_DismemberWindup>施放時間</HPWC_DismemberWindup>
  <!-- EN: How long the pilot holds the target still before tearing off an arm or a leg. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberWindupDesc>駕駛員扯下手臂或腿之前，需要固定住目標多久。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberWindupDesc>

  <!-- EN: Cooldown -->
  <HPWC_DismemberCooldown>冷卻時間</HPWC_DismemberCooldown>
  <!-- EN: The time the pilot must wait between strikes. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberCooldownDesc>每次打擊後，駕駛員要等多久才能再次打擊。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberCooldownDesc>

  <!-- EN: Strike damage -->
  <HPWC_DismemberDamage>打擊傷害</HPWC_DismemberDamage>
  <!-- EN: The damage a strike does to the limb it takes hold of, before the pilot's melee damage factor. A limb with more health than that will be wounded instead of torn off. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberDamageDesc>打擊對所抓住的肢體造成的傷害，尚未乘上駕駛員的近戰傷害系數。承受得住這些傷害的肢體只會受傷，不會被扯下。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberDamageDesc>

  <!-- EN: Drain time -->
  <HPWC_DismemberDrainTime>汲取時間</HPWC_DismemberDrainTime>
  <!-- EN: How long a hemogenic pilot spends draining hemogen from a human target. A full drain will give the same amount of hemogen however long it takes. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberDrainTimeDesc>血原性駕駛員從人類目標身上汲取血原所花的時間。不論花多久，完整汲取一次所得的血原都一樣多。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberDrainTimeDesc>

  <!-- EN: Base hemogen gain -->
  <HPWC_DismemberGain>基礎血原所得</HPWC_DismemberGain>
  <!-- EN: The amount of hemogen the pilot gains from a full drain, which is affected by the target's body size. At zero, the pilot will not drain the target. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberGainDesc>駕駛員完整汲取一次可獲得的血原量，實際數量視目標體型而定。設為0時，駕駛員不會汲取目標的血原。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberGainDesc>

  <!-- EN: Blood loss -->
  <HPWC_DismemberBloodLoss>失血</HPWC_DismemberBloodLoss>
  <!-- EN: The blood loss a full drain causes in the target, on top of the bleeding from the lost limb. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberBloodLossDesc>完整汲取一次對目標造成的失血，失去肢體造成的出血另外計算。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberBloodLossDesc>

  <!-- EN: Blood spatter -->
  <HPWC_DismemberSpatter>濺血</HPWC_DismemberSpatter>
  <!-- EN: The number of blood spatters a strike will leave on the ground around the target. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberSpatterDesc>每次打擊在目標周圍地上留下的血跡數量。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberSpatterDesc>

  <!-- EN: Allow non-hostile targets -->
  <HPWC_DismemberNonHostile>允許非敵對目標</HPWC_DismemberNonHostile>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, the pilot will be able to dismember targets that are not hostile, but this will anger their faction. When disabled, only hostile targets can be dismembered. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberNonHostileDesc>啟用時，駕駛員也能肢解非敵對的目標，但這會激怒對方的派系。停用時，只有敵對目標可以被肢解。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_DismemberNonHostileDesc>

  <!-- {0} the casting time, {1} the cooldown, then the drain's {2} time, {3} hemogen and {4} blood loss percentage, then {5} a count of strikes such as "2 strikes" and {6} a count of the reload item such as "1 component". One key per combination of a cooldown and a drain -->
  <!-- EN: The shoulders hold {5}, and each one is reloaded with {6}. A strike takes {0} to cast, and a hemogenic pilot then drains a human target for {2}, which gives {3} hemogen and causes {4} blood loss. The cooldown after a strike is {1}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberSummary>護肩最多可儲存{5}，每次打擊需裝填{6}。施放打擊需要{0}，之後血原性駕駛員會花{2}從人類目標身上汲取血原，獲得{3}點血原，並造成{4}失血。打擊後的冷卻時間為{1}。</HPWC_DismemberSummary>
  <!-- EN: The shoulders hold {5}, and each one is reloaded with {6}. A strike takes {0} to cast, and a hemogenic pilot then drains a human target for {2}, which gives {3} hemogen and causes {4} blood loss. The next strike can follow at once. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberSummaryNoCooldown>護肩最多可儲存{5}，每次打擊需裝填{6}。施放打擊需要{0}，之後血原性駕駛員會花{2}從人類目標身上汲取血原，獲得{3}點血原，並造成{4}失血。下一次打擊可以立即進行。</HPWC_DismemberSummaryNoCooldown>
  <!-- EN: The shoulders hold {5}, and each one is reloaded with {6}. A strike takes {0} to cast, and the pilot does not drain the target. The cooldown after a strike is {1}. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberSummaryNoDrain>護肩最多可儲存{5}，每次打擊需裝填{6}。施放打擊需要{0}，駕駛員不會汲取目標的血原。打擊後的冷卻時間為{1}。</HPWC_DismemberSummaryNoDrain>
  <!-- EN: The shoulders hold {5}, and each one is reloaded with {6}. A strike takes {0} to cast, and the pilot does not drain the target. The next strike can follow at once. -->
  <HPWC_DismemberSummaryNoCooldownNoDrain>護肩最多可儲存{5}，每次打擊需裝填{6}。施放打擊需要{0}，駕駛員不會汲取目標的血原。下一次打擊可以立即進行。</HPWC_DismemberSummaryNoCooldownNoDrain>

  <!-- Helmet section (Source/1.6/Settings/Settings_Helmet.cs). {0} in every tooltip is the default -->
  <!-- EN: Helmet -->
  <HPWC_SectionHelmet>頭盔</HPWC_SectionHelmet>
  <!-- EN: The sealed visor of the hemophage warcasket helmet keeps sunlight off a pilot who is sensitive to it and steadies a pilot who is afraid of fire. -->
  <HPWC_SectionHelmetDesc>噬血型戰棺頭盔的密封面罩能替對陽光敏感的駕駛員擋住陽光，也能讓怕火的駕駛員穩住心神。</HPWC_SectionHelmetDesc>
  <!-- EN: Sunlight protection -->
  <HPWC_HelmetSunlight>陽光防護</HPWC_HelmetSunlight>
  <!-- EN: When enabled, the helmet will protect a pilot with a UV sensitivity gene from the effects of sunlight. When disabled, sunlight will slow such a pilot and lower their mood as usual. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_HelmetSunlightDesc>啟用時，頭盔會保護帶有紫外光敏感基因的駕駛員免受陽光影響。停用時，這類駕駛員在陽光下會照常變慢，心情也會變差。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_HelmetSunlightDesc>
  <!-- EN: Fire terror chance -->
  <HPWC_HelmetPyrophobia>火焰恐懼機率</HPWC_HelmetPyrophobia>
  <!-- EN: How often a pilot with the pyrophobia gene will flee in terror from a nearby fire, compared to normal. At 0%, the pilot will never flee from fire. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_HelmetPyrophobiaDesc>與平時相比，帶有「畏火」基因的駕駛員因附近起火而驚恐逃離的頻率。設為0%時，駕駛員永遠不會逃離火場。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_HelmetPyrophobiaDesc>

  <!-- Work section (Source/1.6/Settings/Settings_Work.cs, WorkSetting.cs). The boxes are the game's own work types -->
  <!-- EN: Enabled work types -->
  <HPWC_SectionWork>已啟用的工作類型</HPWC_SectionWork>
  <!-- EN: The work types a pilot of the hemophage warcasket can do, out of those that warcasket pilots normally cannot. Work that another mod enables for all warcasket pilots will stay enabled. -->
  <HPWC_SectionWorkDesc>戰棺駕駛員通常無法從事這些工作，但噬血型戰棺駕駛員可以。其他模組為所有戰棺駕駛員啟用的工作會維持啟用。</HPWC_SectionWorkDesc>
  <!-- {0} is HPWC_Enabled or HPWC_Disabled -->
  <!-- EN: When enabled, pilots of the hemophage warcasket can do this work, though you will need to assign it in the work tab. When disabled, they cannot. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_WorkDesc>啟用時，噬血型戰棺駕駛員可以從事這項工作，但需要在「工作」面板中自行分配。停用時則無法從事。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_WorkDesc>
  <!-- {0} is a list of work types as the work tab names them -->
  <!-- EN: The pilot can do {0} work, as well as the work that all warcasket pilots can do. -->
  <HPWC_WorkSummary>駕駛員可以擔任{0}，也能從事所有戰棺駕駛員都能做的工作。</HPWC_WorkSummary>
  <!-- EN: The pilot can only do the work that all warcasket pilots can do. -->
  <HPWC_WorkSummaryNone>駕駛員只能從事所有戰棺駕駛員都能做的工作。</HPWC_WorkSummaryNone>
  <!-- EN: No work is blocked for warcasket pilots, so there is nothing to enable here. -->
  <HPWC_WorkSummaryNothingBlocked>戰棺駕駛員沒有被禁止的工作，因此這裡沒有需要啟用的項目。</HPWC_WorkSummaryNothingBlocked>

  <!-- Quest section (Source/1.6/Settings/Settings_QuestPilot.cs, ResearchGateSetting.cs): the sanguophages of Biotech's sanguophage meeting quest and of its crashed sanguophage shuttle quest, and that shuttle's thralls. {0} in every tooltip is the default -->
  <!-- EN: Sanguophages from quests -->
  <HPWC_SectionQuestPilot>任務中的噬血者</HPWC_SectionQuestPilot>
  <!-- EN: Sanguophages who come to your colony during a quest can arrive already entombed in a hemophage warcasket. One who joins you will stay in it. The thralls of a crashed shuttle can arrive in lesser warcaskets. -->
  <HPWC_SectionQuestPilotDesc>在任務中來到殖民地的噬血者，抵達時可能已經被封在噬血型戰棺內。加入你的噬血者會繼續留在戰棺裡。墜落太空梭上的血奴則可能穿著低階戰棺抵達。</HPWC_SectionQuestPilotDesc>
  <!-- EN: Required research -->
  <HPWC_QuestResearch>所需研究</HPWC_QuestResearch>
  <!-- EN: The research your colony must finish before any of these sanguophages can arrive in a hemophage warcasket. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_QuestResearchDesc>殖民地必須先完成這項研究，這些噬血者才可能穿著噬血型戰棺抵達。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_QuestResearchDesc>
  <!-- The first stop of the slider, before the research projects' own names -->
  <!-- EN: None -->
  <HPWC_QuestResearchNone>無</HPWC_QuestResearchNone>
  <!-- The two quests' subheadings, each over its own rows, and their tooltips -->
  <!-- EN: Sanguophage meeting -->
  <HPWC_QuestMeeting>噬血者會議</HPWC_QuestMeeting>
  <!-- EN: A quest where a sanguophage leader asks you to host a meeting. If you accept, the leader and the other guests will arrive at your colony and spend several hours in discussion. -->
  <HPWC_QuestMeetingDesc>噬血者領袖請你讓他們在殖民地舉行會議的任務。如果你同意，領袖和其他與會者會來到殖民地，花上幾個小時進行討論。</HPWC_QuestMeetingDesc>
  <!-- EN: Leader warcasket chance -->
  <HPWC_QuestMeetingLeader>領袖戰棺機率</HPWC_QuestMeetingLeader>
  <!-- EN: The chance that the leader of a sanguophage meeting will arrive in a hemophage warcasket. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_QuestMeetingLeaderDesc>噬血者會議的領袖穿著噬血型戰棺抵達的機率。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_QuestMeetingLeaderDesc>
  <!-- EN: Guest warcasket chance -->
  <HPWC_QuestMeetingGuest>與會者戰棺機率</HPWC_QuestMeetingGuest>
  <!-- EN: The chance that each of the other sanguophages at a meeting will arrive in a hemophage warcasket as well. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_QuestMeetingGuestDesc>會議中其他每位噬血者也穿著噬血型戰棺抵達的機率。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_QuestMeetingGuestDesc>
  <!-- EN: Crashed shuttle -->
  <HPWC_QuestShip>墜落的太空梭</HPWC_QuestShip>
  <!-- EN: A quest where you can draw a hostile shuttle down to a crash near your colony. Its sanguophage master and thralls will leave the wreck and fight you. -->
  <HPWC_QuestShipDesc>在這項任務中，你可以引導一艘敵對的太空梭迫降在殖民地附近。船上的噬血者首領和血奴會離開殘骸，與你交戰。</HPWC_QuestShipDesc>
  <!-- EN: Master warcasket chance -->
  <HPWC_QuestShipMaster>首領戰棺機率</HPWC_QuestShipMaster>
  <!-- EN: The chance that the sanguophage master of a crashed shuttle will be entombed in a hemophage warcasket, which will make the master much harder to down and capture. Default: {0}. -->
  <HPWC_QuestShipMasterDesc>墜落太空梭上的噬血者首領被封在噬血型戰棺內的機率。穿著戰棺的首領會更難被擊倒和俘虜。預設值：{0}。</HPWC_QuestShipMasterDesc>
  <!-- EN: Master warcasket points -->
  <HPWC_QuestShipMasterPoints>首領戰棺威脅點數</HPWC_QuestShipMasterPoints>
  <!-- EN: The threat points a crashed shuttle quest must be worth before its sanguophage master can arrive in a hemophage warcasket. The storyteller raises threat points with your colonist count and colony wealth. Default: {0}. -->
